                        "source_sense_description": "eine Pflanzenart (Crassula ovata) aus der Gattung Dickblatt, deren Heimat das südliche Afrika ist",
                        "target_lang_word": "money tree",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "money tree",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42518436-57e9-3486-99d0-4d0285377bcf",
                                        "entry_id": "6e401dc5-6447-3d32-a6d2-87d45e042b19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An imaginary tree from which money can be plucked. See money doesn't grow on trees."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "734b45bd-6436-4683-a786-a8ede170763a",
                                                "sense_id": "42518436-57e9-3486-99d0-4d0285377bcf",
                                                "text": "Maybe we could learn how to grow money trees."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7662507-51c6-4170-8b4e-9b1ff16e5463",
                                                "sense_id": "42518436-57e9-3486-99d0-4d0285377bcf",
                                                "text": "Money does not grow on trees. There is no money tree at Mount Kildare. If we had a money tree, boys, there would be no need of the bakery, no need of the raffle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75550d02-d4fb-48d6-aa9e-9a61ed3a8395",
                                                "sense_id": "42518436-57e9-3486-99d0-4d0285377bcf",
                                                "text": "But there isn't a magic money tree that we can shake, that suddenly provides for everything that people want."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d47f642-08a1-4523-9c76-d0bc3561306a",
                                                "sense_id": "42518436-57e9-3486-99d0-4d0285377bcf",
                                                "text": "Her rival […]argued for fiscal responsibility and warned that such a reckless policy would lead to a run on the pound and a calamitous series of mortgage-rate rises. Given this choice, the electorate for the Tory leadership[…]preferred the magical money tree."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8090f7a3-afd9-3b72-9bb0-aedc8cf28dc9",
                                        "entry_id": "6e401dc5-6447-3d32-a6d2-87d45e042b19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The Malabar chestnut, Pachira aquatica."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "name"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9fa27255-3be9-38e9-b62c-45ca4114dfde",
                                        "entry_id": "6e401dc5-6447-3d32-a6d2-87d45e042b19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The jade plant, Crassula ovata."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "920b312f-6e12-3fa9-bec5-23c9e1b4f3d8",
                                        "entry_id": "6e401dc5-6447-3d32-a6d2-87d45e042b19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The cocoa tree, Theobroma cacao."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "014121ad-2b11-3445-a993-9aa4f4312274",
                                        "entry_id": "6e401dc5-6447-3d32-a6d2-87d45e042b19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A kind of holy tree believed to bring money and good fortune."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Chinese"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4810b76-b5a1-3b69-974d-fce5caaf53f2",
                                        "entry_id": "6e401dc5-6447-3d32-a6d2-87d45e042b19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A miniature tree sculpture decorated with currency, often used as a raffle prize or a gift."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "698e8184-bd3c-4cb4-945b-18e784605efa",
                                                "sense_id": "d4810b76-b5a1-3b69-974d-fce5caaf53f2",
                                                "text": "1972, American Association of Occupational Health Nurses, American Association of Industrial Nurses, Occupational Health Nursing, Volume 20, page 26,\nNIAIN′s one money making project of the year, a money tree, was raffled off and won by Virginia Call of Bell and Howell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6f00743-ad09-4153-af59-f159ccc9c007",
                                                "sense_id": "d4810b76-b5a1-3b69-974d-fce5caaf53f2",
                                                "text": "2001, Daniel J. Brown, Chapter 11: School Voluntarism, Social Capital, and Civil Society, Heinz-Dieter Meyer, William Lowe Boyd (editors), Education: Between States, Markets, and Civil Society: Comparative Perspectives, Lawrence Erlbaum, New Jersey, page 173,\nDonations from teachers and others were converted into coinage for a money tree that was raffled for $500."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62b64f58-6293-44df-b3b8-27188bf02c61",
                                                "sense_id": "d4810b76-b5a1-3b69-974d-fce5caaf53f2",
                                                "text": "2003, North Carolina Folklore Society, North Carolina Folklore Journal, Volumes 50-53, page 23,\nSome families offer elaborate money trees, fashioned from decorated branches and streamers made of bills carefully pinned together […] ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51556d11-cda4-37ff-bb34-03f4095b0807",
                                        "entry_id": "6e401dc5-6447-3d32-a6d2-87d45e042b19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cheap tree sculpture, decorated with currency, used as a raffle prize because it would be illegal to offer a cash prize."
                                        ],
